<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Convnet on</title><link>https://younsoid.github.io/categories/convnet/</link><description>Recent content in Convnet on</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en-us</language><lastBuildDate>Sun, 11 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://younsoid.github.io/categories/convnet/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>합성곱 연산</title><link>https://younsoid.github.io/docs/deep-learning/computer-vision/cp10/</link><pubDate>Sun, 11 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://younsoid.github.io/docs/deep-learning/computer-vision/cp10/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="합성곱-연산"&gt;&#10; 합성곱 연산&#10; &lt;a class="anchor" href="#%ed%95%a9%ec%84%b1%ea%b3%b1-%ec%97%b0%ec%82%b0"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;#2026-10-11&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;hr&gt;&#10;&lt;h3 id="1-합성곱-연산"&gt;&#10; 1. 합성곱 연산&#10; &lt;a class="anchor" href="#1-%ed%95%a9%ec%84%b1%ea%b3%b1-%ec%97%b0%ec%82%b0"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h3&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;컨브넷의 특성인 합성곱 연산은 입력이 특성맵이라는 랭크-3 텐서이다.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;이 텐서는 2개의 공간축(높이, 너비)와 1개의 깊이 축(채널)으로 구성된다. 채널 개념은, RGB 이미지는 3개의 컬러 채널을 가져서 채널 3이고 MNIST 이미지처럼 흑백 이미지면 채널 1이 된다.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;합성곱 연산은 입력 특성 맵에서 작은 &lt;line&gt;패치들을 추출&lt;/line&gt;하고 모든 패치들에 같은 &lt;line&gt;변환을 적용&lt;/line&gt;해서 출력 특성맵을 만든다. 출력 특성맵도 높이, 너비, 채널을 가진 랭크-3 텐서인데 출력 텐서의 깊이는 층의 매개변수로 결정되기 때문에 상황에 따라 다르다.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>합성곱에서 깊이</title><link>https://younsoid.github.io/docs/deep-learning/computer-vision/cp11/</link><pubDate>Sun, 11 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://younsoid.github.io/docs/deep-learning/computer-vision/cp11/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="합성곱에서-깊이"&gt;&#10; 합성곱에서 깊이&#10; &lt;a class="anchor" href="#%ed%95%a9%ec%84%b1%ea%b3%b1%ec%97%90%ec%84%9c-%ea%b9%8a%ec%9d%b4"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;#2026-10-11&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;hr&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;입력 값의 깊이, 입력 특성맵의 깊이, 출력 특성맵의 깊이가 각각 의미하는것은?&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-plain" data-lang="plain"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;이미지 (28, 28, 1) ← 입력 값의 깊이 1 (흑백)&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; ↓&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;conv2d(32) 입력 깊이 1 → 필터 모양 3×3×1, 32개 → 출력 깊이 32&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; ↓ (26, 26, 32)&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;max pooling 깊이는 그대로 32&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; ↓ (13, 13, 32)&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;conv2d(64) 입력 깊이 32 → 필터 모양 3×3×32, 64개 → 출력 깊이 64&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; ↓ (11, 11, 64)&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;max pooling 깊이는 그대로 64&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; ↓ (5, 5, 64)&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;conv2d(128) 입력 깊이 64 → 필터 모양 3×3×64, 128개 → 출력 깊이 128&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; ↓ (3, 3, 128)&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;입력 값의 깊이는 모델에 맨 처음 들어가는 이미지 자체의 채널 수이다. 컬러 사진이면 빨강, 초록, 파랑 밝기 세 장이 겹쳐 있어서 3이고, MNIST 같은 흑백 이미지면 밝기 한 장이어서 1이다. 이 단계의 채널은 &amp;ldquo;색&amp;quot;이라는 물리적 의미이다.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>컨브넷의 기본구조</title><link>https://younsoid.github.io/docs/deep-learning/computer-vision/cp9/</link><pubDate>Fri, 09 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://younsoid.github.io/docs/deep-learning/computer-vision/cp9/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="컨브넷의-기본구조"&gt;&#10; 컨브넷의 기본구조&#10; &lt;a class="anchor" href="#%ec%bb%a8%eb%b8%8c%eb%84%b7%ec%9d%98-%ea%b8%b0%eb%b3%b8%ea%b5%ac%ec%a1%b0"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;#2026-10-09&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;hr&gt;&#10;&lt;h3 id="1-기본-구조"&gt;&#10; 1. 기본 구조&#10; &lt;a class="anchor" href="#1-%ea%b8%b0%eb%b3%b8-%ea%b5%ac%ec%a1%b0"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h3&gt;&#10;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-plain" data-lang="plain"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;input (, 28, 28, 1)&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;conv2d -&amp;gt; (, 26, 26, 32)&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;max pooling 2d -&amp;gt; (, 13, 13, 32)&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;conv2d -&amp;gt; (, 11, 11, 64)&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;max pooling 2d -&amp;gt; (, 5, 5, 64)&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;conv2d -&amp;gt; (, 3, 3, 128)&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;flatten -&amp;gt; (, 1152)&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;dense -&amp;gt; (, 10)&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;기본 컨브넷 모델의 층 구성과 output 크기는 위와 같다. conv2d와 max pooling 2d의 출력은 (높이, 너비, channels) 크기의 랭크-3 텐서이다.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>